nAdvisory (not pass or fail conditions): clamp(-1,0,3) should give 0, clamp(5,0,3) should give 3 and clamp(2,0,3) should give 2. The repository's tests and build should pass. A test for clamp should exist."}},"run":"r1:0.brief","from":"\"briefing\"","hash":"7c4a52f8405a","writes":[{"path":"briefs","from":"event.output","set":"/states/briefing/invoke/onDone/actions/0"}]}}
